Third-party code and components

0. Backdrop / AndroidLiquidGlass (Phase 5: consumed as a dependency)
   Source: https://github.com/Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass, pinned to commit
   65ab177e90e5c1d8c62e70cf7755841982da65f6 (published artifact 2.0.1).
   License: Apache-2.0. The project uses the `io.github.kyant0:backdrop` API;
   no library source files are copied into TermX.

1. Termux terminal-emulator (Phase 0: consumed as a dependency)
   Source: https://github.com/termux/termux-app (pinned v0.118.3 via JitPack)
   License: Apache-2.0 for terminal-emulator and terminal-view, per the
   exception in termux-app LICENSE.md. Originally from jackpal/Android-Terminal-Emulator
   (Apache-2.0).

2. Termux terminal-view (Phase 1: vendored into app/src/main/java/app/termx/terminal/view/)
   Source: https://github.com/termux/termux-app, commit
   8629e632fcb95da272221be327db653fb24befe9; original paths under
   terminal-view/src/main/java/com/termux/view/ and terminal-view/src/main/res/.
   License: Apache-2.0, under the module exception in termux-app LICENSE.md.
   Package names and resource references were adapted for app.termx. The terminal
   input type was changed to a normal text field to keep voice input available.
   Scrolling is kept in the view and SIXEL bitmap rendering was omitted to match
   the v0.118.3 emulator dependency.
   A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt.

3. ReTerminal (Phase 2 onward: adapted code)
   Source: https://github.com/RohitKushvaha01/ReTerminal (pinned in docs/REFERENCES.md)
   License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 Rohit Kushvaha

   TerminalSidePanel.kt adapts the session drawer structure from
   core/main/src/main/java/com/rk/terminal/ui/screens/terminal/TerminalDrawer.kt
   at commit 839950dec204b69b8d670cdcc7d34d650be248ba. TermX's panel uses its
   own session service and installed-distro model.

4. wolfi-terminal (Phase 1 onward: adapted code)
   Source: https://github.com/leloush-x/wolfi-terminal (pinned in docs/REFERENCES.md)
   License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 Rohit Kushvaha

   ExtraKeysRow.kt adapts the key mapping from
   core/main/src/main/java/com/rk/terminal/ui/screens/terminal/virtualkeys/VirtualKeysListener.kt
   at commit d4cc3912d08edbf8557aac446e76fca0bee08ce3.

   MainActivity.openAllFilesSettings() adapts the app-specific Settings intent
   and fallback from core/main/src/main/java/com/rk/terminal/ui/screens/settings/SettingsScreen.kt
   at commit d4cc3912d08edbf8557aac446e76fca0bee08ce3. The storage-tier policy,
   bind table and SAF copy code are new TermX code; the unconditional bind logic
   in MkSession.kt was explicitly excluded.

